    L.append("- Each estimate is also reported drug-weighted (the mean of per-drug AUROCs over drugs with both classes) next to the pair-weighted within-drug AUROC. Differences between arms, and between an arm and a scorer, are paired differences of within-drug AUROC on shared bootstrap draws.")
